  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Mysogynous; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man standing in front of a rusty truck with a text overlay that claims his wife threw him out after catching him measuring his cock, and that it 'reaches the back of her sisters throat.' This content objectifies the man's body and reduces women to their physical attributes, particularly focusing on genital size as a measure of worth or relationship viability. This is a classic example of mysogynous content, as it perpetuates harmful stereotypes about women's bodies and reinforces the idea that women's value is tied to male genital size. The meme uses the juxtaposition of the man's self-deprecating or boastful claim with the image of a rugged, rural man to create a humorous but degrading portrayal of male insecurity and female objectification. The intent is to shock or provoke laughter through crude, sexually explicit humor that targets women's bodies and reinforces patriarchal norms.",
